      "side": 1,
      "message": "If any capability is a mix of standard and non-standard both in that case will it be passed planely as vendorCodecSpecificCapabilities only (in that case codecSpecificCapabilities can also be null)?",
      "revId": "760c255f5ddbc24b19a5ef99c7cf4c789a13feeb",
