      "writtenOn": "2023-12-08T15:09:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeap I think we could make it @nullable since empty config is still a valid one. \n\n@smoreland@google.com Is it ok to make the only field within the DataPathConfiguration parcelable nullable, or we should rather make this whole member object nullable in the parent parcelable (LeAudioAseConfigurationSetting)?",
